(Currently, enforcement officers conduct packaging compliance inspections manually. This requires visually verifying over twenty mandatory) Tj
T* (declarations with magnifying glasses and physical rulers, checking numeral heights against Principal Display Panel \(PDP\) area tables,) Tj
T* (cross-referencing multi-page gazette schedules for allowed standard pack sizes, and drafting handwritten Form A \(Weight\) or Form B \(Volume\)) Tj
T* (inspection sheets. This manual workflow takes 20 to 30 minutes per packaged commodity, creating severe enforcement bottlenecks across) Tj
T* (millions of retail SKUs.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 473.9529921259841672 Td
(INSPACK resolves this bottleneck by converting multi-view physical packaging photographs \(Front, Back, Side\) into structured legal data. It) Tj
T* (evaluates this data through a 100% deterministic statutory rules engine, highlights non-compliant declarations with color-coded on-image bounding) Tj
T* (boxes, and automatically compiles court-admissible Seventh Schedule Form A & Form B inspection dossiers with photographic evidence and) Tj
T* (Section 65B electronic evidence certification in under 60 seconds.) Tj
